SUMMARY:GILSONS Australia Tour 2026
DESCRIPTION:Fibra Entertainment presents: Gilsons Australia Tour 2026 Forme
 d in 2018\, Gilsons isn’t your average family band. The trio\, represent
 ing two generations of one of Brazil's most legendary families\, balance o
 riginal music with an homage to the music of Gilberto Gil\, their father (
 José) and grandfather (Francisco\, João) . Known far and wide as one of 
 the progenitors of the countercultural and widely popular tropicália move
 ment\, Gilberto remains one of the biggest names in Música Popular Brasil
 eira. Though a seemingly impossible task\, Gilsons builds upon the Gil fam
 ily musical lineage with their blend of pop rock\, samba\, reggae\, and Ba
 hian (northeastern Brazil) rhythms. The band's debut album\, Pra Gente Aco
 rdar\, earned a Latin Grammy nomination for Best Contemporary Pop Album in
  Portuguese Language\, and they’ve taken to the stages of many of Brazil
 ’s major festivals – including Lollapalooza Brazil\, and\, alongside a
 nother national musical icon\, Jorge Aragão\, for over 100\,000 people\, 
 at the Rock in Rio festival.
LOCATION:Miami Marketta (18+)\, 23 Hillcrest Parade
URL:https://www.miamimarketta.com/ticketed-events/gilsons
